<section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="about-kicker">Deep Learning IndabaX Botswana 2026</p>
        <h2>Part of the wider Deep Learning Indaba network, growing AI from the ground up in Botswana.</h2>
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div>
                <p>IndabaX Botswana is part of the wider Deep Learning Indaba network: a pan-African grassroots movement strengthening machine learning and artificial intelligence across the continent.</p>
                <p>As a local chapter, we bring that movement home to Botswana by creating space for students, researchers, developers, startups, industry partners, and public-sector stakeholders to learn, build, lead, and collaborate.</p>
                <p>The 2026 gathering is community-driven and practical: it spreads scientific knowledge, showcases cutting-edge applications, introduces beginners to deep learning, and builds a community of responsible AI practitioners.</p>
                <p>Our theme, <strong>"Our Data. Our Intelligence. Our Future."</strong>, is a call to move from consumption to ownership: African data, African builders, and measurable benefits for African communities.</p>
                <div class="ix-free-pill"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> The IndabaX is <strong>free to attend</strong> for students.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="event-details-card">
                <h3>2026 Event Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Dates:</strong> 29 - 31 July 2026</p>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> Botswana School of Business Sciences</p>
                <p><strong>Location:</strong> Gaborone, Botswana</p>
                <p><strong>Expected delegates:</strong> 300+ in person</p>
                <p><strong>Programme:</strong> Keynotes, tutorials, hackathon, AI Fest, poster session, workshops, meetups, mentorship, booths, and awards</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

